# Development happens on Windows; Docker entrypoints and CI run on Linux. CRLF in a
# shell script or a YAML entrypoint fails there in ways that are painful to diagnose,
# so line endings are normalised to LF in the repository regardless of platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

pnpm-lock.yaml linguist-generated=true -diff
